WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.129 --> 00:00:09.760
In 536 A.D., there was a worldwide dust cloud
that blocked out the sun for a year, resulting

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:20.700
in widespread famine and disease.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:27.399
The most common reaction from men confronted
by TV Licensing Enforcement Officers is, 'I

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:30.240
thought my wife was dealing with it.'

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:36.520
A kilogramme of houseflies contains more protein
than a kilogramme of beef.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:42.750
Despite popular belief, studies show men are
not more flatulent than women.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.180
The acnestis is the part of the back that
is impossible to scratch.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:55.260
After George W. Bush was re-elected president
in 2004, the number of calls from US citizens

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:04.559
to the Canadian Immigration authorities jumped
from 20,000 to 115,000 a day.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:09.140
Thomas Edison proposed to his second wife
in Morse code.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.130
Until 1857, it was legal for British husbands
to sell their wives.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:22.820
The going rate was £3,000 or £23,000 in
today's money.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:28.829
Some species of scorpion survive on just one
meal a year.

00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:34.790
In space you cannot cry because there is no
gravity to make the tears flow.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:40.060
Australia has 10 times more camels than koalas.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:49.429
In 1987, American Airlines saved $40,000 by
removing an olive from each salad in First

00:01:49.429 --> 00:01:50.829
Class.

00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:57.679
The statue of Winston Churchill in Parliament
Square is electrified to stop pigeons perching

00:01:57.679 --> 00:01:59.060
on its head.

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:05.789
Bill Clinton was mauled by a sheep at the
age of eight and didn't learn to ride a bicycle

00:02:05.789 --> 00:02:08.369
till he was 22.

00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:16.680
To protect its public image Google own hundreds
of other domains including googlepoo.com and

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.880
googlesucks.com.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:24.910
Victorian guidebooks advised women to put
pins in their mouths to avoid being kissed

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:31.440
in the dark when trains went through tunnels.

